WEBVTT

00:00.820 --> 00:07.940
Today I've been married for 12 years. The man
of my life, who loves me and respects me. He

00:07.940 --> 00:14.000
isn't just my love, he's my best
friend. But it wasn't always like this. I was once

00:14.000 --> 00:23.100
a woman who loves too much. And I don't wish
that on anyone. I suffered so much with the

00:23.100 --> 00:29.140
end of a relationship that I
cried every single day, for six months.

00:32.060 --> 00:39.040
In the first week, the sadness was so much
that I got pneumonia. All I wanted

00:39.040 --> 00:47.360
was to die. My whole life revolved
around him. All my plans, all my

00:47.360 --> 00:53.360
purpose, revolved around that
relationship. And when he ended it

00:53.360 --> 01:00.380
with me, there was nothing left. Nothing at all.
On top of that, my mother had just

01:00.380 --> 01:00.880
passed away.

01:03.400 --> 01:09.520
It felt like they'd taken not just the
ground under me, but ripped out a piece of

01:09.520 --> 01:18.340
my heart. It hurt physically. I thought
I'd never love anyone again. And at the

01:18.340 --> 01:22.920
same time, I was terrified just
imagining going through that again.

01:25.940 --> 01:33.760
It took me about a year
to recover. And when I recovered, I swore

01:33.760 --> 01:42.080
to myself that I would never go through
that again. From that day, I

01:42.080 --> 01:48.120
started hard work. It wasn't easy.
I looked at my shadows, at my

01:48.120 --> 01:56.760
emotional games, at my neediness.
And there I learned to let go. I had to

01:56.760 --> 02:03.200
learn to let go. I learned to set the
other person free. I learned to set limits, to say

02:03.200 --> 02:11.340
no, to be myself. Without needing to please
the other all the time. I beat down my

02:11.340 --> 02:15.760
neediness. And I want to teach that
to you, who are tired of suffering. Because I

02:15.760 --> 02:22.340
know this pain. And I believe you
don't deserve this. That's 18 years helping

02:22.340 --> 02:27.140
women get out of this pattern of suffering
from attachment. And I want to help you too, if

02:27.140 --> 02:34.260
that's what you want too, of course. Today I
stopped seeing clients at the office. Today my

02:34.260 --> 02:40.020
main dedication is being a mentor and
teacher. The school serves through

02:40.020 --> 02:45.700
our trained therapists. But I know there's
still a lot of women stuck in this place.

02:45.780 --> 02:51.020
And it's not just women. Men too.
So I created a solid solution, with

02:51.020 --> 02:58.800
a lot of love, for you. It's called Let Go
for Good. It's a guided practice, with

02:58.800 --> 03:07.020
sacred geometry. To rebuild the synapses
of your brain and your emotions. It's

03:07.020 --> 03:14.760
less than 15 minutes a day. And look, I'll
be straight with you. This is not a

03:14.760 --> 03:20.180
relaxing meditation. It's not a positive
affirmation to repeat in the mirror and

03:20.180 --> 03:28.020
pretend everything's fine. When you
become dependent on the other, the person becomes

03:28.020 --> 03:35.100
a drug. When they disappear, you go into
withdrawal. It's an addiction. It feels like weakness,

03:35.240 --> 03:42.200
but it's chemistry. And chemistry can be
reconfigured. What's going to happen

03:42.200 --> 03:48.960
when you start the protocol? Well, the
relief starts almost right away. Many

03:48.960 --> 03:56.740
women resolve it in 7 days. Some harder
cases in 14, 21 days. It's not

03:56.740 --> 04:06.100
magic, okay? It's you doing the work. 15
minutes a day. And who is it for? This is

04:06.100 --> 04:13.160
for you who has a specific person
stealing your sleep right now. A breakup, a

04:13.160 --> 04:19.100
love that wasn't returned. Someone
who left and you can't stop

04:19.100 --> 04:27.300
thinking about. If you're reading the same
conversation for the thousandth time. If you check

04:27.300 --> 04:32.740
your phone waiting for a message that doesn't
come. It's you I'm talking to.

04:37.300 --> 04:42.340
I want so much to help you get out of this. That
I can say it's practically a

04:42.340 --> 04:50.460
gift. Let Go for Good costs 149
reais. It's less than half of what you

04:50.460 --> 04:56.620
would spend on a therapy session with me.
I'm doing it at this price so I can

04:56.620 --> 05:01.660
help as many people as possible.
So, share it with that friend of yours

05:01.660 --> 05:06.900
who you know is in this situation.
Letting go isn't becoming indifferent. It's not

05:06.900 --> 05:12.920
about no longer feeling. It's recovering your
sovereignty. It's loving yourself enough not to

05:12.920 --> 05:23.880
accept crumbs. The button is right down
here. Take the first step. You don't have to

05:23.880 --> 05:33.740
spend even one more day like this. Now it's in
your hands. Bye. Bye. Bye. Bye.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.980
Bye.
